# Matrix-based Decision Diagram Simulator (mbdd)

A Python package for simulating quantum circuits using matrix-based decision diagrams.

---

## 📦 Installation

Clone the repository and install in editable mode (so that local changes to the code are immediately available:

```bash
cd matrix-based-ddsim
pip install -e .
```
